{"job_id":"F-12d4fe273f72b5d640a7","family_id":"F-12d4fe273f72b5d640a7","title":"스카우트활동 육성에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":16,"target_id":"b27cf2bcc4f9adf0ceb8c949b20f0261205fb5fb0708b16c2ee46ae529ab48dd","source_hash":"ec0e6c32f7c1e11700af277ae00d47b74624ce08f5a7dc9340591240300cdd3e","text":"关于促进童军活动的法令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":58,"target_id":"8341e2f4f18804019acf5df8a05c9ed5f2bc7fc676c17e5aec57c8ea8cb8d8a7","source_hash":"ff3a5e01691b6879ba52c3079ee0a408f1481cf4bc41e522a2952114e7cfcb2b","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是支持、指导和促进大韩民国青少年的童军活动。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":58,"end":209,"target_id":"05adc3882d2f7883954c610ba0ba268ee6e1fb14a490f76d1eda49a340865a0a","source_hash":"a0c298b7a11d3c6c97c8a95f35a1cc70897d0f7f260192bcf3c297a09248307a","text":"第二条（定义）本法中，“童军活动”一词是指通过按照童军教育方法培养青少年品格、增强体魄、掌握实用技能，从而促进国家发展和全人类友谊，并培养服务社会精神的活动。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":209,"end":321,"target_id":"5b5d6759db28db8947c86ae50affa2ffa56c8bfd1111eef7a87c4ee5c00bf375","source_hash":"1ec37d330293e3315b31d9ca8e9f37533d1082dd52ab0b4d07cc65af847d05e8","text":"第三条（与国际组织等的合作）童军活动应与下列国际组织和团体密切合作进行。\n1. 世界童子军\n2. 世界女童军\n3. 其他与童军活动相关的组织\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":321,"end":468,"target_id":"9c6680315b5bf34992661d31bb83782a837cf50a41cb653114e14a75a04a3b6b","source_hash":"b966bfc8d2dba70eff63a453d66bc635ce1977e4a7b8187336048dd9897da902","text":"第四条（童军活动的组织）\n① 童军活动应当由具有法人资格的组织（以下简称“童军组织”）进行。\n② 关于第 3 条第 1 款和第 2 款规定的组织，第 1 款规定的童军组织机构应代表大韩民国的童军活动，但每个组织只能有一个代表。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":468,"end":526,"target_id":"cbeb6c5ee671b13b45eb96e1a24a3918228657ce121fafe2e37eb3afc5ed363f","source_hash":"44493b784b9545072b183a1ea68382c5c0c375bbb14a657a7de4258d8c46b2d9","text":"第五条（合作与支持）国家或地方政府可以合作和提供支持，例如为童军活动提供便利。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":526,"end":658,"target_id":"703a0d36f51822ad6e81b3afc29f77ac772817332c7ffcf92bd7a28408e631b8","source_hash":"beb08dd10e03ebb0452945a5030e7b38076d865c6c91240896f98d41f987f8c8","text":"第六条（补贴）国家或地方政府可以向童军组织机构提供补贴，用于支付童军活动所需的国际捐款、童军活动所需的设施和运营费用，以及经性别平等和家庭部长认可的国内或海外活动的费用。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":658,"end":770,"target_id":"112fe8cf0926aaab08d15b25f2d1fc42e39af8a349ee6b24eb9de4cac8d32eb2","source_hash":"d979c0de0a682b41ed27ba915106750c9f0da2d094bb9862f227d8f52fb3f380","text":"第七条（童军支援机构的商业活动） 支援童军组织机构的个人或组织（以下简称“童军支援机构”）经性别平等与家庭部长批准，可以从事必要的营利性业务。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":770,"end":958,"target_id":"bb955cd5a669691e581a1faada56820b0a15397b357fa827ac51c5bbc13cda4e","source_hash":"cb9c2805c25ad2414f5007d9a5cf68be7a2bc86520e2ba1df4d44a32670fb5cb","text":"第八条（暂停营利性业务的命令）  如果性别平等和家庭部长认定，根据第七条开展营利性业务的童军支援组织已将该业务所得利润用于童军组织机构管理以外的其他用途，或存在此类用途的风险，部长可以命令相关童军支援组织暂停该业务，并采取其他必要措施。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":958,"end":1061,"target_id":"3e46a2b21c0bc3bde66337e0ca695209364f146a295b732fafc31f5eb1ad3b9e","source_hash":"da71c962a22458c9d30674e13ecc2c2586ab72be52cf251ce6ed745ada3b026b","text":"第九条（项目报告）童军组织机构应当按照性别平等和家庭部部长的规定，向部长报告其项目计划、项目进展和项目绩效结果。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1061,"end":1170,"target_id":"c21bdd0def727d6a916ea760b4d8b64ad295606ac5980510283a95b6f085bb2b","source_hash":"5268583fcc4e8476b9802eb5bb0c6af9c31e41bef0313a7dedfbadb2b5dce2b9","text":"第十条（禁止使用相似名称等）\n① 任何人不得使用可能被误认为是童军组织机构的名称。\n② 除非是童军组织机构的成员，否则不得使用该机构指定的符号。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1170,"end":1268,"target_id":"92277b20bb395673e71dd8dbc7ea1dd2a414389659e6001fb99727f52d7ac53d","source_hash":"442a78b3c7b09ff566051cf0c1ae935ebf6beb7b8a8bfdd1ad9aadd419f95fb0","text":"第11条（行政罚款）\n① 违反第十条规定的，处以不超过200万韩元的行政罚款。\n② 第1款规定的行政罚款由性别平等和家庭部长负责征收。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1268,"end":1400,"target_id":"abe39c4c6c1180dea2f2123b79137f160e7d4255a8e44f46fb9328cdfc2e7570","source_hash":"684393f513f0de0894a5ca6d8ad2b08dc5571b6f3e016559d71c76e99d6b574f","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 2118，1969 年 7 月 28 日>\n\n①（实施）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）在本法实施时已存在的韩国童子军总会和韩国女童子军总会，应分别视为根据第4条规定担任童子军运动的监督组织。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1400,"end":1431,"target_id":"a5b780f968b82c24a7f34b863cda7a91b99fcc1c64c5672ecb53de910bedcfb9","source_hash":"003db7c6cb4052faec38095433d19e94c4db356ad657a0816e6e52cd5a667654","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第4268号法令，1990年12月27日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1431,"end":1469,"target_id":"82203eb371eca74aa5b665d15b5cad1df860cd6bfa9453de737c827866cfb056","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1469,"end":1484,"target_id":"1c7d4059c6b67ea2ae5507969d1bdb9b72e3fd921cb2fc67ded8a57f842a941d","source_hash":"83d7e2617f4bf3ca8b29241abcde12e5b43dc5f987d1316993039fbd766a366d","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1484,"end":1550,"target_id":"c5255d487287f91c7968a8e23855ec62dd642f79fd4af492212e7678da98c2dd","source_hash":"5f3f8731146c5847a390150d38fc58ec26e41b516fa300ef1e77f758819e2f89","text":"第八条（为协调各部委事务而修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《促进童军活动法》修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1550,"end":1605,"target_id":"9986c85e1491adb612ac95f4e19bee1c68f7ba276a385c455cb56bc3a5e6f895","source_hash":"6afad9fc36d2ef93a5d902fdfed050a735b4c5898f4d7b6205a5a947cb33035f","text":"  第 6 条至第 9 条中，“教育部长”应改为“体育和青年部长”。\n\n  ③ 至 ⑩ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1605,"end":1620,"target_id":"732b26510abbc3a249d0406c5fe4a5892799fcda8bf9c2e712ee492c7a762b77","source_hash":"4cebcba8640f61c525b67cbaab1cbf376d3cc86144e5665cb29d1c360dcfa1a5","text":"条款 9 和 10 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1620,"end":1649,"target_id":"0661c437dda92963a1ca921073f0f5e6647c22e5793d8da91d79d6c705c106ee","source_hash":"c3e32fc3e7ccbfa7c1fedde3b5992786cf10bfa15e36b0f6f5d7341e45ab815f","text":"附录（政府组织法）<1993年3月6日第4541号法令>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1649,"end":1747,"target_id":"35d70797728e73e1475b6a7afabd8b3fe439d8ccb8d4f34f4d9e7a894c055b2c","source_hash":"4879fc8c61202e28e95786fe5b6605e71cb44da93b88c3785a6ec6d8b60acd78","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……附件第三条至第五条修正条款的生效日期为有关该组织的总统令的生效日期。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1747,"end":1755,"target_id":"f506cdc69f50922c0dba5dcf4f9e8fb4203b2613b2dfb92191bd1ca02da78c3c","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"文章 2 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1755,"end":1821,"target_id":"365e129c013fa3035eeb886d833d9b5cca1afa4c64db7f5a82c13467fdd99163","source_hash":"9a1223fe598ce7cff61845270c290e369b5378e781deb8ed60c08b1d33ee514c","text":"第三条（为设立文化体育部而对其他法律的修正）① 省略\n\n  ②《促进童军活动法》修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1821,"end":1881,"target_id":"e6470910fb09b50662bd522f982074f68cf113204d00dfe08c09e1cee62509d5","source_hash":"d992d6c3518dc0a56197d768aca6bb185bd20f2817ab49ab094606e34e619a46","text":"  第 6 条至第 9 条中，“体育和青年部长”应改为“文化和体育部长”。\n\n  ③ 至 <35> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1881,"end":1895,"target_id":"f97a808a95fdcc850304c6fc0aea83ad81ed913a251e709aa39280df9420274d","source_hash":"505b854c331342cb48efd5424cf798126129d808876646cd1a9e4b5b22346bf6","text":"条款 4 和 5 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1895,"end":1926,"target_id":"c910f7812f63076340a3d227f7b57b22ec09eb450dc139bfb863ec412f097865","source_hash":"c1031f2629e8c1f25a70b68aeb7645023b74b281debf57965fd38572b49711cb","text":"增补（青年框架法）<2005年3月24日第7421号法案>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1926,"end":1990,"target_id":"7d39e7139aeebf02e712fc8fa602d41ae4a26348622f546e4de9dbedc25b2e92","source_hash":"63a09a9e72d5c0f10c19df3b3e0bda06d5298429e3edce1e08ef0af772e03978","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自总统令关于青年委员会组织的法令颁布之日起三个月内生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1990,"end":1998,"target_id":"06f5b7f8199a1ae392a180a076d2b450ac6253b37c7353c902b1946bae974648","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1998,"end":2225,"target_id":"d35687063c4d60186eb53f266c556da659a9433cd771e85749c5c4dc433a69ae","source_hash":"b7f44979bd36be62b94a5294479d01790555557cc0cb83a06ee8d6b1199f4269","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 《促进童军活动法》部分修订如下。\n\n  在第 6 条中，将“文化体育部长”替换为“青年委员会”；在第 7 条中，将“文化体育部长”替换为“青年委员会”；在第 8 条中，将“文化体育部长”替换为“青年委员会”；在第 9 条中，将“文化体育部长”替换为“青年委员会”，并将“致文化体育部长”替换为“致青年委员会”。 \n\n  ⑤ 至 ⑨ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2225,"end":2233,"target_id":"425760dc0e6689c8ea779c67ec0976cfe17165bd6108cd508c5171a5cf4fec43","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2233,"end":2265,"target_id":"adfe07cffb8238f09c3523bae1208fda8d72e4712b1cf4f15a167544f43d2298","source_hash":"938e5f6d5b5490fbe6ba976f845e0ec34366460368eb3866ef72b2020f1541e4","text":"增补（青年框架法）<第7799号，2005年12月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2265,"end":2304,"target_id":"bbe63c02fd672fb55d24ff38dec840067b9a447b9dcae295aacb147a1fbe89b7","source_hash":"5bb812d6ea61a2f0dcd56832fadc39b677eac1f0f7bc0e1930094e4e141ee137","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2304,"end":2312,"target_id":"b8616f23f52806e60179b749dac2830da8f1d528c9535daed568f2d2c24c0de7","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2312,"end":2372,"target_id":"b5939c6a6648c45155348a724c51a9629c2d57657c2d3bee749af7b66501c3ce","source_hash":"c61c358f2dc758cccf600e91a90586259a97d35919194f87d44c682691f29c55","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至④ 已省略\n\n  ⑤ 《促进童军活动法》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2372,"end":2428,"target_id":"699ab92de2e0f3cc67dd93ddac36169d0b161c2cf8445b2f363542b71909c1fc","source_hash":"7ccfa08ce4a8fca3349e3e3a4e43c36abb899e636544219abe3fa7d9f6240d03","text":"  第 6 条至第 9 条中的“青年委员会”应改为“国家青年委员会”。\n\n  ⑥ 至 ⑪ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2428,"end":2436,"target_id":"a17c1605ac02bbef3f34a898f6bd02c1f56a0ce0fe0c0ba8c6494b18874bc340","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000848-276883-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2436,"end":2466,"target